SpotDL — Human-friendly README

SpotDL is a command-line tool that turns your Spotify links (tracks, albums, playlists, even artists) into properly tagged audio files. It looks up each Spotify item on YouTube/YouTube Music, downloads the best match, then adds clean metadata—title, artist, album, cover art, and often lyrics—so your library stays organized. 
