What it actually does (in plain English)

Takes Spotify links you paste in (or whole playlists/albums).

Finds the same songs on YouTube (or YouTube Music).

Downloads the audio and tags it with Spotify metadata: artist, album, track number, cover art, and lyrics where available. 
spotDL
+1

Note: SpotDL does not download from Spotify’s servers. It matches Spotify items to YouTube sources and downloads those. 
